#: main.ts:65
msgid "VestraBili plays Bilibili links with yt-dlp, a free open-source tool. It downloads it once (about {} MB) from the yt-dlp project's official GitHub releases, checks it against the project's signed checksums, and keeps it up to date. yt-dlp is in the public domain (Unlicense) and is not part of VestraBili."
